<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan Copper sets qtly divs.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan Copper sets qtly divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS, La. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoran Copper &amp; Gold Inc said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class A stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.225		    $0.225</p>
<p> Pay		     May 1</p>
<p> Record	     April 15</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>Freeport-McMoran Copper also said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class B stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.225		    $0.225</p>
<p> Pay		     May 1</p>
<p> Record	     April 15</p>
</text>
